# Caves of Chaos Adventurer comes down on turn 1 off three Moxen and a Mountain. Entering, it takes the initiative, and
# taking it ventures into Undercity: Secret Entrance fetches the Forest. At Bot1's turn-3 upkeep the initiative ventures
# again, and of Secret Entrance's two arrows Bot1 follows the one to Lost Well and scries 2. The Adventurer attacks for
# 5, exiles the Mountain on top, and Bot1 plays that Mountain from exile as its land for the turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Caves of Chaos Adventurer
Island
Island
Forest
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Caves of Chaos Adventurer.Cast
Bot1.Search(Forest)
? Initiative = Bot1
? Bot1.Dungeon = Undercity: Secret Entrance
? Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Forest
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
Bot1.Modes(Lost Well)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Dungeon = Undercity: Lost Well
Bot1.Attack(Caves of Chaos Adventurer)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Exile = Mountain
Bot1.Exile.Mountain.Play

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Initiative = Bot1
Bot1.Dungeon = Undercity: Lost Well
Bot2.Life = 15
Bot1.LandsPlayed = 1
Exile.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Mountain; Mountain; Mox Ruby; Mox Pearl; Mox Sapphire; Caves of Chaos Adventurer
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Forest; Mountain
